silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_07_knowledge_graph_cross_reference_sections_01_kg_cross_reference_concrete_anchor_node1 silm:hasLongDescription "The KGCrossReferenceSourceNode is KGAssertion_Mittens (KG source leg). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Source (typed federation object)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
